@startuml
' ============================================================
' RecipeVault — Software Architecture Diagram (Level 0)
' ============================================================

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F7F4EE
  BorderColor #7A7568
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #444444
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam title {
  FontSize 16
  FontStyle bold
}

title RecipeVault — Software Architecture (Level 0)

actor "User\n(Browser)" as User

rectangle "Frontend\n(Nginx :80)\nHTML / CSS / JS" as Frontend

rectangle "Backend\n(Express :5000)\nNode.js / REST API" as Backend

database "MongoDB :27017\nrecipevault DB\n(recipes collection)" as MongoDB

User --> Frontend : HTTP requests\n(browser)
Frontend --> Backend : /api/* (reverse proxy\nvia Nginx)
Backend --> MongoDB : Mongoose ODM\n(CRUD queries)
MongoDB --> Backend : Recipe documents
Backend --> Frontend : JSON responses
Frontend --> User : Rendered UI

note right of Backend
  Rate limiter: 100 req / 15 min per IP
  Routes: GET/POST /api/recipes
          GET/PUT/DELETE /api/recipes/:id
          GET /health
end note

note right of MongoDB
  Collection: recipes
  Indexes: text (name, description,
           ingredients)
end note

@enduml
